{"id":"llvm-ranlib.1","n":"llvm-ranlib","s":"1","src":{"r":{"pkg":"llvm","ver":"19.1.7-1.el9","repo":"AppStream","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/AppStream/x86_64/os/Packages/l/llvm-19.1.7-1.el9.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/llvm-ranlib.1.gz","sha256":"0d68e80c24fab8653e8e67050af189ca585d2b1504f3c3437d31e2c211ce5e6d","date":"2025-01-23","origin":"19"}},"nopt":{"r":0},"desc":"generates an archive index","r":[["NAME","<p>llvm-ranlib - generates an archive index</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>llvm-ranlib</b> [<i>options</i>] <i>archive...</i></p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p><b>llvm-ranlib</b> is an alias for the llvm-ar tool that generates an index for one or more archives. It can be used as a replacement for GNU's <b>ranlib</b> tool.</p> <p>Running <b>llvm-ranlib</b> is equivalent to running <b>llvm-ar s</b>.</p>"],["SEE ALSO","<p><b>llvm-ar(1)</b></p>"],["AUTHOR","<p>Maintained by the LLVM Team (https://llvm.org/).</p>"],["COPYRIGHT","<p>2003-2025, LLVM Project</p>"]]}